  "description": "Fast HTML sanitizer for .NET 9/10/11 against XSS, built on z3l.FastHtmlParser: keeps only the allowed tags, attributes, URL schemes and CSS properties of untrusted HTML (comments, posts, e-mails, scraped pages) and writes the result anew, with every text and attribute escaped and every element closed. No AngleSharp dependency; linear time on any markup.",
